    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ultra-popular Japanese VTuber group hololive takes on the world of traditional Japanese card games in Holo's Hanafuda!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb4What Is Hanafuda?\ud83c\udfb4</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanafuda, Japanese for &quot;flower cards,&quot; are traditional Japanese playing cards beloved by people of all ages. Twelve suits in total make up a deck, with each suit corresponding to a month of the year, and each card decorated with a unique and gorgeous illustration that depicts seasonal imagery matching the card's suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/5ace7e215c66fb23c9a99e5600798dcf.poster.avif?t=1753887676\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/5ace7e215c66fb23c9a99e5600798dcf.webm?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/5ace7e215c66fb23c9a99e5600798dcf.mp4?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/de1b0556600b3369dff40c9a021662bd.poster.avif?t=1753887676\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/de1b0556600b3369dff40c9a021662bd.webm?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/de1b0556600b3369dff40c9a021662bd.mp4?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4<strong>Game Features</strong>\ud83c\udfb4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner-Friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holo's Hanafuda comes with a robust suite of helpful features that simplifies play with on-screen markers and tips, making it easy to enjoy an array of hanafuda-based games without memorizing card values and rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Twist on Hanafuda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holo's Hanafuda introduces a brand-new twist on classic hanafuda gameplay with the Holo Awase rule variant! Use a deck of hanafuda cards that feature gorgeous hololive designs, then unleash powerful talent skills by matching cards that show the same hololiver in this koi-koi variant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the hololive members you know and love as they enter a world inspired by hanafuda imagery. This immersive narrative adventure is chock full of banter, battles, and hololive vibes. Plus, it eases you into hanafuda gameplay by teaching you how to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to a healthy helping of single player options, you'll also be able to challenge players from across the globe in thrilling online matches. Pick your game, create a lobby or invite a friend, and hanafuda to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create and Share Handmade Bento Boxes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom bento boxes in an in-depth bento mode! Collect points by playing games, then use them to unlock a wide variety of ingredients and decorations that you can mix, match and make bento magic with! Bentos always taste better when shared, so after you design your ideal bento, exchange your culinary creation with other players online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/20355bc761dd6d2b057009a67877cc8e.poster.avif?t=1753887676\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/20355bc761dd6d2b057009a67877cc8e.webm?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/20355bc761dd6d2b057009a67877cc8e.mp4?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4<strong>Characters</strong>\ud83c\udfb4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude08Nakiri Ayame</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGreetings, Humans! Yoohoo!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kimono-clad Oni girl from the Underworld Academy. As she loves to prank people, she always uses will-o\u2019-the-wisp on them just to have fun. Many may not realize it, but she is actually the president of the student council.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3dShirakami Fubuki</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGood foxy day! I'm Shirakami Fubuki!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White-haired animal-eared otaku fox. She loves talking with people and will be happy if you give her the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She aims to become a top otaku idol while enjoying each and every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf32Ookami Mio</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHellooowl! It is Ookami Mio!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A black-haired wolf girl who appeared on our radar randomly. She often shows up around shrines. She likes gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38Sakura Miko</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNya-hello~! I'm Sakura Miko, an elite shrine maiden-idol!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shrine maiden from the Virtual Sakura Shrine. With a vivid admiration for idols, she constantly pushes herself to greater heights to become a top elite shrine maiden-idol like no other!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well... a self-proclaimed 'elite,' to be exact. Fans would think &quot;clutz&quot; fits her better...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4<strong>Story</strong>\ud83c\udfb4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One otherwise normal day, hololive members Ayame, Fubuki, Mio, and Miko are suddenly drawn into a mysterious world full of hanafuda imagery. Soon, strange, shadowy figures appear to challenge the four to a series of high-stakes card battles that will decide the girls' fates! But hey, it's not all danger and darkness in hanafuda land\u2014our heroines will also meet friends and allies along the way in this entirely original hololive hanafuda story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/2bc87a711c28b8763c366c17e1a21e3c.poster.avif?t=1753887676\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/2bc87a711c28b8763c366c17e1a21e3c.webm?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/2bc87a711c28b8763c366c17e1a21e3c.mp4?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
