our culinary creation with other players online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/20355bc761dd6d2b057009a67877cc8e.poster.avif?t=1753887676\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/20355bc761dd6d2b057009a67877cc8e.webm?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327640/extras/20355bc761dd6d2b057009a67877cc8e.mp4?t=1753887676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb4<strong>Characters</strong>\ud83c\udfb4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude08Nakiri Ayame</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGreetings, Humans! Yoohoo!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kimono-clad Oni girl from the Underworld Academy. As she loves to prank people, she always uses will-o\u2019-the-wisp on them just to have fun. Many may not realize it, but she is actually the president of the student council.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3dShirakami Fubuki</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cGood foxy day! I'm Shirakami Fubuki!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White-haired animal-eared otaku fox. She loves talking with people and will be happy if you give her the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She aims to become a top otaku idol while enjoying each and every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf32Ookami Mio</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHellooowl! It is Ookami Mio!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A black-haired wolf girl who appeared on our radar randomly. She often shows up around shrines. She likes gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c